 sewhere in the Netherlands\; no travel or accommodation covered.\nAward: E
 UR 250 contribution to material costs per project (EUR 100 per time-based 
 work)\, plus space\, promotion and documentation. No artist fee. No applic
 ation fee.\nDuration: One week (Wednesday to Sunday)\, within 26 February 
